# NOTE: android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar IS committed on purpose.
# Android Studio and `flutter build` require it, and a checkout without it
# cannot build. It is a 44 KB official Gradle file (taken unmodified from the
# Gradle 8.14.0 source distribution, md5 15a2cd45cb049056c465b481d6eabb3c),
# not a generated artefact. Keep it in step with
# android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties.
